      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naselle%2C_Washington",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Finnish and Scandinavian immigrants settled Naselle, and the community still celebrates that heritage through a Finnish library and a Logging Heritage Room.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
